Listing keys seen with `7z l -slt -ba` (7-Zip 23.01 and p7zip 16.02) that were not in the whitelist before this change:
  Metadata Changed   UDF images, HFS+ volumes (also inside the DMG)
All other keys (including p7zip 16.02's `User` and `Group` for ext4 and DEB) were already allowed.
